  "title": [
    "[The Graveyard Temporalis]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Gnarled roots have broken ground and upset headstones, gravestones, and monuments, leaving them toppled, set off-kilter, or broken beneath the tree to which the roots belong.  Without foliage, the limbs above offer little impediment in seeing the various poppets, fetishes, and cloth-shrouded dolls dangling from them by short lengths of hemp twine.  Some of the miniature effigies are obviously older than the others, but they hang all the same, stark and still even when a breeze whistles through the limbs."
  ],
